    {
      "dimension": "keyboard",
      "status": "SUPPORTED_FOR_DEMONSTRATED_CONTROLS",
      "observation": "Actual keyboard input changes the daily metric and opens its exact-table fallback, and Enter activates Quality while focus remains on that control. On mobile, 15 ArrowRight key presses scroll the focused Model cost comparison region until Accounted exposure is in the viewport. The final test no longer assigns scrollLeft to prove forward access; its later assignment only restores the initial position. This is scoped keyboard evidence, not a full keyboard-only navigation or screen-reader certification.",
